  <book code="1TH" style="id">Edolo [ETR]</book>
  <para style="rem">Corrections to draft made by Duluba Mar 05, entered by Jan Apr 05.</para>
  <para style="rem">15 Septemba 2016 Duluba, Hamaga, Awi, Adagu, Gosäia, Ado besulo nilïa hamogisa.</para>
  <para style="rem">25 Septemba 2016gi</para>
  <para style="rem">Age Desalonaigada Ginidoea hamogisa maadei dialea.</para>
  <para style="rem">6 Jan 2017 JG begins exegetical check at 1.1. Finished 16 Jun 2017, including reading through Intro.</para>
  <para style="rem">Team final draft 28 May-6 Jun 2018. Village tested 9 Jul 2018.</para>
  <para style="rem">Start Consultant Check with John Bruner 8 Apr 2022, finished 11 Apr 22. Jan Gossner and Duluba Ibo present as translators and Heose Galima and Fumada Nagumu as UNSs.</para>
  <para style="h">Age Desalonaiga</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Des</para>
  <para style="toc2">Age Desalonaiga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Foloea Mi Gäwila Geleso Sosogo Desalonaiga Nefolalebe Amolima, Beba We Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="mt">Foloea Mi Gäwila Geleso Sosogo Desalonaiga Nefolalebe Amolima, Beba We Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ado Dëdëi Dibe Amoïe Neala Olelo Oboba</para>
  <para style="ip">Foloea udia dolö Godea wela ifosisi Desalonaiga nefolalo amolima beba afädë dëdëla ïasi. Amoïe mida, ilia hä, gelomäiage, ilile asigi delësila namiäiage, dëdëla ï. Ilia Godema asigi afädë negela namolöi neebe amoge, amase, boba hamola namolöi neebe amoge, Dimodia säsebe amo Foloea nabala, Godema nesegei. Amala sälahilä, Folo hï e dafidi ilibalä nelo amogi, neda gowe gadoi nelomelëlage, amase, Yesu obëgëmolö ilia nabi amoge, helësëlasila dëdëi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amase, Dafidilo Geloi obëgësolo amo gala, udia dolö Gelesoma asigi afädë negei baagoi amolidale nowemolömelë. Nilï made baagoi gähe sefolalebeweda, ilibalä gaalu mu baidilidaia Dafidilo Geloi gausiamolö afiamolömelëla säla, Foloea dëdëla ïasi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amala dëdëlahilä, Dimodia ado säi nabi amoïege, Foloea ado elö säla obëgësalea, Geleso e obëgëmäia beaha neada, dilia dihilile asigi neala gelolasila digi, ugila negela digila, walio hamosa neebe go gadola wäla, hamosamu namialola säla dëdëla ïasi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="ms">Folola, ebalä hamoi gaalu hamolo nefolalo amolalia Desalonaiga ili helësëla säosäosa nelo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1TH 1-3">Age Desalonaiga 1–3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Folo Sailasa Dimodila nilïa udia dolö Geleso sosogo Desalonaiga nefolalebe dilima beba gowe dëdëla ïasisago. Nilïle Naado Godeïege, Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoïege dili nefolaleagomelë.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ugila negelasiloge, neala dalulasiloge, dilima ïmäia hamesa neawe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Desalonaiga ilia asigi afädë negei amogi Foloea obeägï</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Dili sulubadela helësëla, nilïa segeyo sulubadelagi nesegela digi, dilile ëi säla Godema adola digisa aligilomelë. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Amala säha neada, nilïa nilïle Naado Godeïe siigi nea, dilia asigi afädë negela hamoi hamoi amoïege, boba hamola nea, hamoi baagi sëi hamosa nebegoïege, nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoma asigia sisiläfüsa nea, yöi diëgi, aso maadela, gelola nebegoïege, helësësa aligilomelë. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, nilïa helësësaleada, Godea dili boba hamola, hïlefalï nafolai nefolaleala helësësamelë. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Mida, nilïa Ado Mala Hedabi dili neebea gui gaula misi amoda, adoeamu gaula misi mademelë. Amoda geloibaläge, Eleloi Gesamibaläge, nilïle asigi afädë negei geloi amoda, dilia beala dawadigi amomelë. Nilï dilibalä nea, ugila negela hamosa nelo amoda, gomalä hamoila dihili dawadigi nebegomelë.<verse eid="1TH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Dilia nilïle malage, Dafidilo Geloiïe malage, bëgëla hamosa aligilo. Amase, Godeïe ado mala neala gaula nelo ameada, yöi yafie beasebegi, Eleloi Gesamia dili neala obeägïlasimelë. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Amala hamoi ameada, Masedonia Bolobinisimadige, Agaiamadige, udia dolö Gelesoma asigi afädë negei sulubadelama, mala hedabi hamola olei gabio. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Dafidilo Geloiïe ado mala dilia säla ïïa asi amoda, Masedonia segeamadile Agaia segeamadilemu made. Dilia Godema asigi afädë negeigoge, sege dibe sulubadelaea nabala daidosa maadei gabio. Ameada, nilïa ilima bu daiasela säla ïmolö helësësa mademelë. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Mida, nilï dili neebea maasebegi, dilia nilïma obeägïla damelë hamolahilä, gauia idogoi ameada, udia dolö sege amogi neebe amoli sulubadelaea säsäi awäha dialea. Dilia dafidi wäfalï gode amo fisila, namolöi neebe Gode dofä amoma besula, amoïe hamoi hamolo besela galai amoge, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />amase, Godeïe malö e selesaia mosöala obëgëla misiäiala beaha nefolalebegoge, ilia säsäi awäha dialeamelë. Malö amoda Godea baagoiala nowelasi. Amoda Yesu, hobea Godeïe mihalälo besela galamolö dibe amo baagimäia, nilï sigi obëgëlo amomelë.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Foloea Desalonaiga nea hamoi hamosa nelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, nilï dili neebea maalahilä, hamoi hamosa nelo amoda, hamola waeasei made amo, dihili dawadigi neagomelë.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abosolo 17.1-9 bimalo.</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Nilï dili neebea Desalonaiga, aso, made maala Filibai nebegi, gaamu amogi nefolalo amolia nilï neala sëlasila gagadesa nelo amoda dilia dawadigi neagomelë. Dili neebea guwi odoaea nilïbalä ado nii nelo gaso, nilïle Godea nilï neala gelolasisebegi, nilïa dilima Ado Mala Hedabi Godemadila misi dibe amo säla ïmelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Nilïa dili Gelesoma asigi afädë negemäia wesaleada, halowela helësëlo, asigi nafade musügä negelahilä, dili dahila neala, made oleleimelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Amalebeda, Godea nilï fedogola bealahilä, hïle hamelo amea nilïa ïe Ado Mala Hedabi amo säla olelemäia, ea nilïma ïasio. Ado amo säla olelesaleada, udia dolöea obeägïmäiala olelelo made. Nilïle asigi fedogola melëlo Godea obeägïmäiala olelelomelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nilïa dili neala golila ado sämolöge, asigi musügä negela dilile nelebo dibe amogi gesami moholöge, amo gadola hamolo made nea, säla olelesa nelo amoda, dilia dawadigi. Amase, Godeage amala säla ulufamolöi nea. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Dili neebe goeage, udia dolö odoa nefolalebe amoliage, nilïle ëi gauia adamäiala made helësëi nelomelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Nilï Gelesoïe abosolo dolö nelo amea, dili yölasila nilï ugila negemäia sämolöi nea gaso, säla made nelo. Amala made säla, dilibalä hame negela neada, emea malö geleä sigi aligilo amo gadola sigi nelo amomelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Nilïa dili boba edefade hamoi neebe amea, dilima Godeïe ado mala säla ïmolö amomu made, nilïa nihïlï nilï ïmolö amoge dofea gabula helësëimelë. Mida, dili hä, nilï sosogofalï besela galai amea.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, nilï dilibalä nea, naaboea hamoi baagi sëi hamosa nelo amoda, dilia dawagomelë. Godeïe Ado Mala Hedabi säla ïaha neada, dili yölasila afädëa ïmäiala made helësëla, nihïlï naha namolö amoïe hamoi nilïa yoba gasigige, baagi sëla hamosa nelomelë.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Udia dolö asigi afädë negei nefolalebe dilibalä nea, mala nilïa hamosa nelo amoda, diliage, Godeage, säla ulufamolöi nea. Nilïa Godeïe siigi mala mogoi hedabi hamosa neada, asialada, hamolo mademelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Malö eedoea ïe malö sigi aligilo amo gadola, nilï dilibalä nea, dili afädë afädëlabalä mala afädëdila hamosa nelo amoda, dihili dawagomelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Amala hamosa neada, nilïa dilile asigi delësilasila, gelolasilage, amase, dili Godeïe mala bëgëmolö dibe amo gadola bëgëla mosäiage, ado säla ïahamu nelo amomelë. Dili Godea Beaha Maadela Sigi Neebea ami, ïe yo digalo hïdo elöi neebea ami awäla namiäia, ea dili wesa neamelë.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Geleso sosogo amolia asigi afädë negei gelola nea, yöi gaula nelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Nilïa Godeïe ado mala säla ïasebegi, dilia dolöïe ado gabula made helësëla, Godeïe ado dofä gabula nabi amoïe, nilïa Godema nesegesamu aligilomelë. Ado amoda dofä Godeïe ado. Gelesoma asigi afädë negei nefolalebe dilile isogi, ado ameada hamoi hamosagomelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, Yudia segea Geleso Yesuïe udia dolö Godea wela ifosisi nefolalo amolima hamoi amo gadola, dilige sëlasi gabugo. Yu dolö sosogo hilimu sëlasisa nelo amo gadola, dilige dihilile sosogoea sëlasisa nebego. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Yu dolö ilia Dafidilo Geloi Yesuge, bea sälo nefolalo amolige nufudalahilä, nilïge nesila digisa nelomelë. Godeada ilibalä made obeägïsa. Udia dolö sulubadelabalä ado nelo neebe amea, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Yu dolö made, fii odoama ado mala made säla ïmäia, ilia nilï idi gahamu aligisio. Amoïe mida, Godea udia dolö amoli sigi made obëgëmäiaïe amasio. Amase ameada, ilile nafade hamoi amo edela nobala, ilia nafade hahamolamu awäha nefolalea. Ameada, Godeïe mihalälo ilima dofä misi dialea.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea Desalonaiga bu elö moholö helësëi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, Yuda ilia nilïma hamoia amila, nilïa dili dïgïla holöbö gasi gala neada, nilïa dilile migalï made beala nea gaso, nilïle asigida dilibalä neamelë. Amala helësësa neada, nilïa dili edefademalä hamela, bu bimolöila helësëla, dili neebea moholöïe idi hogosamu nelo. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Nilïda, hä, dili neebea moholö helësëi neamelë. Neda Folo, nada afädë made, segeyo nahuigi mudulä hamoi gaso, mugabe Saidania nilïle idi gasio. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesu e bu obëgësegi, ïe siigi nilïa abeahäla gelola obeägïla namolödu. Dilima maade galëda, edoea nilïa hamoi hedabi gowe gadoi hamoimelëla säla ulufala olemolödu. Be, nilïle bidida, dilimelë. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ä, dofä. Dilia hamosebe amea nilï obeägïlasisebe ameada, nilïa dilima obeägïsa neamelë.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Foloea Desalonaiga ili gelolasimäia Dimodi fisiga gai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nilïa dili asigila, beaha namolöda dofea made gabugi, hä, alïmu Adenesi namolöla helësëlahilä, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />alïa nilïle nedoo Dimodi e dili bimäia fisiga gai. Dimodi eda Gelesoïe Ado Mala Hedabi säla ïlo neada, Godebalä nea hamoi gaalu hamosa aligilomelë. Ea dili gelolasila, dilile asigi afädë negei amo iilasimäia, e fisiga gai amoda, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />dilia yöi gaula, së naha nebego, fologola fudugiloeaïe amai. Yöi amoli gaumäia Godea nilï memelei amoda, dihili dawagomelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Nilï dafidi dilibalä nelo amogi neada, dilima nilïa gomalä säla ï. Sëi elö elöla nilï mia besela galamolömelëla säla ï amomelë. Segeyo nafade amoda, hä, nilï mia besela galai dibe amoda, dilia dawadigi. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Na beaha namolöda dofea made gabugi, dilia asigi afädë negeigo amalasi neebelela bimolöïe, Dimodi e mosalaigomelë. Na helësësaleada, fedogola melëlo mugabe Saidania, dilile asigi afädë negeigo fisimäia, dili säfe negesegi, nilïa hamoi hamosa nelo amo waeaseloeamelë.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dimodia ado hedabi gaula misi amogi Foloea obeägï</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Amaimo, Dimodi e dili neebea guila, hädamade maala, nilïbalä nea. Ea sähalea, dilia asigi afädë negei amo amalasi neamelëlage, dihilimu boba hahamosa neamelëlage, ea obeägï ado amo nilïma säla ïasio. Amo gadola säla ïahalea, nilïa dili helësësamu nea, dili bimolöila helësësa neebewe gadola, diliage segeyo sulubadelagi nilï helësëla obeägïlomu nea, nilï siia bimolöila säha neamelëla säi amo nilïa nabimelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, amala hamosa neamelëla ea säla ï ameada, nilï yömolöge sëmolöge dibea amila, dilia asigi afädë negei amo amalasi neamelëla säi nabi ameada, nilïle iso asigi neala gelolasimelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Hä, dilia Dafidilo Geloima dilahilä, gelola namolöi neebe ameada, walio dofä nilïle iso asigi neala obeägïlasi neamelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Nilïa dili helësëla, nilïle Godeïe sidaia edefademalä obeägïsa nea. Amaha gaso, nilïa helësësaleada, obeägïlo nilïma ï dibe ameada, nilïa Godema nesegela säla, bu dabe abeahäla obëgëmolödula helësësamelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Nilïa dili bimolöila helësëla, yoba gasigige Godema adosamu neada, dilile asigi afädë negei amo obobaloea, nilïa neala gelolasila moholöïe, adosamu aligilomelë.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e ili neebea moholö amoïe, Godea idi gai doga negemäia, ea Godema adosa nelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nilïle Naado Godeage, nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesueage, nilï dili neebea moholö amo idi doga negemäia hamesa neamelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Dihilimu boba hamosa neebe goïege, udia dolö sulubadelabalä boba hamosa neebe goïege, Dafidilo Geloia bäulasila, nobala adugaha namiäiala säha. Dilia boba hamolo amoda, nilïa dilima boba hamosebewe gadola hamomäia hamesamelë. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesula, e fii asigi mogoi sulubadelabalä maasolo amo gala, dili nilïle Naado Godeïe siigi, nafade made baai, mogoifalï namolöïe, ea dilile iso asigi neala gelolasimäiala säha.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="ms">Desalonaiga ilima mala mogoi amoli ilile namolögi gelolasila bäumaloi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1TH 4-5">Age Desalonaiga 4–5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Susugu hamomabiola säi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, na ado wagahalea gomalä säla ïahago. Dilia Gode obeägïmäia gomalä hamosa namialola, nilïa dafidi säla ï amo dilia gelola hamosa neagomelë. Amai nilï walio, Dafidilo Geloi Yesuïe ëigi nea, dilima gelola säsebe amoda gowe. Dilia hamosa neebe amo gadolamu made, baalage hamomäiala säha.<verse eid="1TH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Nilïa Dafidilo Geloi Yesuïe geloigila nea sähaleada, dilia gomalä hamosa namolö dialeala säla ï amoda, dihili dawadigi nebegomelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Godea hamei neebe amoda gowe. Dilia dilile namolö sulubadela ema odala ïala, eleloi namialo. Susugu hamolo mala dibe amo sulubadela sisigaha namialo. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4-5" />Amase, fii odoa, Gode helësëlo made nefolalebe amolia susugu hïdo elöla hamolo amo gadola made, Godeïe siigige, udia dolöïe siigige mala hedabi bëgëla hamosa neada, dilile domalo hedabola sigi namolö helësëmalo. <verse eid="1TH 4:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Amo helësëla, didoolali asiala dahila nimabio. Mala amoli gadoi hamosa neebe amoligalida, Godea së ïmolömelëla nilïa dilima dafidi gelola säla ïaha nelo amomelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Godea nilï wei amoda, nigime baai mala hamosa namiäia made, nilïle namolö egali ïalahilä, eleloi namolö mala amo bëgëla hamosa namiäia weimelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Amai gabugi, afädëa ado säla olelesebewe baagi ïaseda, dolöïe ado neadigimolö mademelë. Eada, Godea Eleloi Gesami diligali ïlo neebe amoïe ado neadigisa neamelë.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nilïa mala hedabi hamomolö amo gelolasimolö dialea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Geleso sosogo nefolalebe amoli boba hamolo amoïe, nilïa beba dëdëla ïmolöi dialeala helësësa mademelë. Amoïe mida, dihilimu gomalä boba hamomolö dialeala Godea säla olelei amea. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Masedonia Bolobinisi segea Geleso sosogo nefolalebe amoli sulubadelama boba hamosa nefolalebegomelë. Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, dilia baala gelola hamosamu namialola säla dëdëla ïahago. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Amala hamosa neada, nilïa dilima dafidi säha nelo amo gadola, asigia hame negela aumala nea, dihilile hamoi hamomolö amo helësëla, naaboea hedabola hamosa namialo. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Amala helësësa aligiseda, udia dolö segea nefolalebe amolile siigi, dofä mala mogola hamolo nea, nelebo afädë ufoida, made bimolömelë.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dafidilo Geloi e obëgësolo amo gala, nilï neala gedolasimolö</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, udia dolö baagoi amolima edo hamomolödu, amo dilia hedabola helësëmäiaïe sähawe. Amase, udia dolö odoa Gelesoma asigia sisiläfüsa aligilo made amolia baagoigi didigaolo amo gadola, dilia amamäia made hamesamelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Mida, Yesu baagola nowei amo nilïa dofäla helësëse ameada, udia dolö Godema asigi afädë negei baagoi amoli, Yesuïe geloigila Godea neala nowelasisegi, Yesubalä obëgëmolö gabula helësësamelë.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Dafidilo Geloiïe ado nilïa dilima säsebeweda gomalä. Dafidilo Geloi obëgësolo amo gala, nilï made baagoi nefolalebeweada, udia dolö dafidi baagoi amoli baagila, dofä nilïdale dafidi made moholömelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Segeyo amo gala, Godea ado gelola sämolö amoge, selesaia fii dafidilo amea ado uuala sämolö amoge, Godeïe melo fuuloea fuumolö amoge, Dafidilo Geloi hï e Hebenila digasegi, udia dolö Gelesoma asigi afädë negei baagoi amolidale nowemolömelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Amo baagiada, nilï udia dolö made baagoi nagadaia nefolalebewe, ea neala gegedolahilä, baagoi dafidi nowei amolibalä gedola, Dafidilo Geloi e gausiamolöïe, mu baidilidaia fedafiamolömelë. Amalahilä, nilï Dafidilo Geloibalä gedola namolöi namolömelë. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Amala namolö gabugi, hä, dilia dihilimu adowe säla ïaha neada, iso asigi neala gelolasisa namialo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nilïa Dafidilo Geloi obëgëmäia daiala namolö</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, amala hamomolö amoda, nilïa dilima segeyo gowegilage, eso si gowegilage säla, dëdëla ïmolöi dialeala made helësësamelë. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Dafidilo Geloiïe segeyo amo, fa nelo dolö gasigi mulo amo gadoi amoda, dihili hedabola dawa gomelë. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Udia dolöea sähalea, Nilïda nudulä made, dofea neawela säha neëgi, ili neala nafademolö amo, aabela misi dië bimolö. Udiaea malö ägümolö salea, aabela sëlo amo gadoi bimolö. Ilia sisigamolöi made bimolömelë.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, dilida gasimi sagaia made nebego, fa nelo maasegi fudugilo amo gadola, segeyo amo besela galasolo amo galada, dili fudugimolöi made bimolömelë. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mida, nilï gasile gasimi sagalo elele made nea. Dili sulubadelada, yo digalole, esolele malö nebego. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Amai gabugi, nilïa udia dolö odoa amoli gadoi made namolöla. Ili adi elaboi diëgi, nilïa idihë nea, asigi sigi namolöla. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Udia dolö süwialo neebe amolida, gasigi süwia dilo nea, amase, udia dolö gagaolo neebe amolida, gasigi gagaolo ödä nulo nea. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Amala hamolo amo gadola made. Nilï esoïe neebe ameada, nihïlïle asigi sigi aligimolöla. Amala neada, nudusalea bidagia salugala aligilo amo gadolada, nilïa asigi afädë negemolöle boba hamomolöle salugala namolöla. Amo salugalahilä, nudusalea habuga salugalo amo gadolada, nilï damula mosäia, asigia sisiläfüsa namolö amo salugala namolöla. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nilïa Godeïe mihalälo dibe amoïe së muäia, ea nilï memelela ifosi made. Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesomadila nea, damula aulo gaula namiäia, ea nilï memelela ifosi nea. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Geleso e obëgëseda, nilï baagola made namolöi neëgi galëge, ma, baagoi galëge, mogela made, ebalä gedola namolöi namolöïe, e nilïle baagoi. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Amala hamoi gabugida, dilia walio hamosa nefolalebego gadola, dilia dihilile asigi neala gelolasila digi, iila ugila negela digisa nebegoda, amala hamosamu namialo.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamomolö dialealage, dili helësësa neamelëlage, Foloea ado säla wagai amoïege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, nilïa dilima gomalä säla ïahago. Dili häuala ugila negelo dolö amoli hawa nagadaiala namialo. Ilia Dafidilo Geloiïe ëigi dili beaha aligilo nea, ado säla ïadigi, hamogila digisa neamelë. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ilia hamoi hamosebe amo, dilia ili hedabola helësëla obeägïla, dofä boba hamosa namialo. Amase, dili sulubadelaeage, dihilimu aeaeahamu namialo.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, dilia hamomolö dibe amoda gowe. Hamoi hamomolö habobalo nefolalebe amolima gelola säla ïmalo. Bedälo nefolalebe amolimada, ilile asigi delësimäia, gelolasila ado säla ïmalo. Amase, asigi hubabelei nefolalebe amolida, ugila negemalo. Sulubadelabalä aabela habobala made, geleä sämalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Amaimo, afädëa dili afädëma nafadela hamoseda, amoma nafade hamola obëgëmabio. Segeyo sulubadelagi, Godeïe udia dolö nefolalebe amolimage, amase, udia dolö odoamage, mala hedabimu hamosa namialo.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Amaha neada, dilia segeyo sulubadelagi obeägïsamu nea, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Godema adosamu namialo. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Dili neebea ami hedabi diëge, nafademolö diëge, Godema nesegesamu namialo. Dilia Geleso Yesuma dila nea, mala amo gadola hamosa namiäia, Godea hamesa neamelë.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Eleloi Gesami dilima neebe amo usimabio. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Bea sälo nea ulufala sälo afädëa ado säla ïaseda, memalä gadoi hamola, gagadela sämabio. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ado sulubadela mogola säsebele, ma, halowela säsebelela fedogola bealahilä, mogola säse amoda neala gaumalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Mala nafade elö elöla sulubadelada, sisigahamu namialo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Neala aeala dalulasilo mi Gode neebe amohï, dilile namolö neala hamogila, dili sulubadela nigime baai made, eleloi namiäiaïe säha. Nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Geleso obëgësegi, dilile gesamiage, asigiage, domaloeage asiai maade, hedabifalïmu namiäiaïe sähago. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Dili wela ifosilo amoda, säla waeaselo made neebe ameada, dofä hï amala hamomolömelë.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, dilia nilïle Godema adolasimalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Dilia Geleso sosogo nefolalebe amoli sulubadela gausiaha nea, mimisa namialo. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Dafidilo Geloiïe ëigila na dilima gelola säla ïahago. Godeïe udia dolö nefolalebe amoli sulubadelaea nabuäia, beba gowe nidela säla ïmalo.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nilïle Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoïe ugila negelasilo dilibalä diamiäiamelë.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 5:28">Hä amo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>